# Blog post standards

- Filename: kebab-case, matching `slug` when possible.
- H1 title, then excerpt, then `<!-- more -->`.
- H2 for sections, H3 for subsections.
- Images go in `docs/writing/posts/img/`.
- Link the post from `docs/writing/index.md` if it should appear on Writing.
- Do not edit `mkdocs.yml` or `overrides/` for a normal post.
